| **Pending PO** | An inferred case (F1) awaiting a wiki ruling | PO rules; TP keeps, edits or deletes the case |
| **Automated** | A test carries the case ID; the file pointer says where | Reconciler |
| **Manual** | Deliberately not automated, with a one-line reason stated in present terms ("timing-dependent: tunable threshold") | Nathan approves |

